OL,3,AMajor Thanksgiving storm brings
OL,4,Aflooding, flight delays across US
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe FAA has previously warned that
OL,7,Fdelays would be possible "throughout
OL,8,Fthe week" as a result of the rain and
OL,9,Fwind that are forecast.
OL,11,FMeanwhile, almost one million
OL,12,Fhouseholds were without power on
OL,13,FThursday night, with Pennsylvania,
OL,14,FMaryland and Virginia the hardest hit
OL,15,Fstates.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/39
